+</style></head><body>
+<button class="print" onclick="window.print()">Save as PDF</button>
+
+<h1>Your Financial Behaviour Report</h1>
+<p class="sub">MindfulFinance · ${esc(date)} · participant code ${esc(results.participantId)}${
